        "comment": "Forecast Snow Stability: Further unstable windslab will develop on North-West to North-East aspects above 950 metres. West and East aspects will also be affected due to cross-loading. The greatest instability will be in steep locations such as gullies, gully tops, coire rims and convexities. On these aspects, cornices will be fragile. Below this altitude and above 700 metres isolated deposits of windslab will be present in wind sheltered locations. The avalanche hazard will be Considerable.",
